[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9841.03, "timestamp": "02:44:01", "text": "疯狂的事？我不知道。我当时就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9843.269, "timestamp": "02:44:03", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9845.67, "timestamp": "02:44:05", "text": "我当时就想，“是啊，乔克斯，你得这么做。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9847.83, "timestamp": "02:44:07", "text": "这些东西。即使你不需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9851.59, "timestamp": "02:44:11", "text": "要做到这一点，你就必须去做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9853.67, "timestamp": "02:44:13", "text": "现在可能看不出来，但以后会明白的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9855.429, "timestamp": "02:44:15", "text": "在遥远的未来才有意义。我应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9857.67, "timestamp": "02:44:17", "text": "为了未来而这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9861.269, "timestamp": "02:44:21", "text": "我就是这么说的。我现在很早就这么做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9863.19, "timestamp": "02:44:23", "text": "所以我不需要担心这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9895.269, "timestamp": "02:44:55", "text": "我也喜欢网站上的那些东西，我不需要。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9898.469, "timestamp": "02:44:58", "text": "我的意思是，我必须这么做，因为我"}]